name: Timeline Entry
description: >
  Immutable entry in an append-only Timeline. The Timeline Provider assigns
  sequence and timestamp, links the entry to its predecessor, and authenticates
  actor and available source attribution. A feeder validates, orders, and
  filters entries before passing eligible events to a processor.

timeline:
  type: Coordination/Timeline
  schema:
    required: true
  description: Timeline containing this entry.

sequence:
  type: Integer
  schema:
    required: true
  description: >
    Strictly increasing position of this entry within its timeline. Sequence,
    rather than timestamp, is the authoritative intra-timeline order.

prevEntry:
  type: Coordination/Timeline Entry
  description: >
    Previous entry in the same timeline, normally represented as a pure
    reference. The first entry may omit this field.

timestamp:
  type: Integer
  schema:
    required: true
  description: >
    Microsecond timestamp assigned by the Timeline Provider for cross-timeline
    ordering and completeness. Timestamps may repeat within a timeline and do
    not replace sequence as its authoritative order.

actor:
  type: Coordination/Actor
  schema:
    required: true
  description: Actor attributed as the writer or submitter of this entry.

source:
  type: Coordination/Source
  description: >
    Optional provider-authenticated attribution of how the entry was submitted,
    such as through a browser session, API call, or document request. Source
    complements actor attribution and does not grant authority by itself. A
    policy that requires or excludes a source category must treat an absent
    source as not satisfying that source constraint.

onBehalfOf:
  type: Mandate/Mandate Authority
  description: >
    Optional mandate-backed authority under which actor claims to act for
    another actor. A feeder validates this authority before delivery when the
    requested action is not directly eligible through a source channel.

message:
  schema:
    required: true
  description: Message or event recorded by the entry.
